msgid "HobbyKing Hydropro Inception"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:10
#: 1f51dc3b0a054094a41b7697d66e4ea4
msgid "The HobbyKing HydroPro Inception is a high speed (over 11 m/s) electric powerboat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:13
#: 0fbd0c5b8614428bbf2fc4cc66af6253
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:15
#: 1676aeaf2220487a83caf9922153a5fd
msgid "`HobbyKing HydroPro Inception <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/alpha-1000mm-rtr.html>`__ (discontinued but the `Super Surge Crusher <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/super-surge-crusher-90a-twin-hull-brushless-r-c-boat-730mm-arr.html>`__ may be similar)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:16
#: 0b26db9441e6419e948026703ae38294
msgid "two `Nano-Tech 4S 4000mAh batteries <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-nano-tech-4000mah-4s-30c-lipo-pack-wxt60.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:17
#: 644d76253ecd4659b2a3555b46cacb4a
msgid "`XT60 Y-cable <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/xt60-harness-for-2-packs-in-parallel-1pc-2.html>`__ to connect batteries in parallel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:18
#: ee6b750b795f401db67558f3316779f3
msgid "`Holybro Pixfalcon <http://www.holybro.com/product/8>`__ with `GPS <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/ublox-micro-m8n-gps-compass-module-1pc.html>`__ and `telemetry <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/holybro-telemetry-radio-v3-100mw-915mhz.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:19
#: fdb6d9c61d654180930a8f281679e7d8
msgid "6 channel (or more) transmitter like the `Futaba T10J <https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:21
#: 6a7d8baf867143b6b023dc2d2eb99294
msgid "The inside of the vehicle becomes a bit wet during operation so it is important to take steps to keep the electronics dry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:23
#: f5e6b1c8ad7c433b9d93a8057c473e3f
msgid "For this build a 3cm x 10cm rectangular hole was cut on the underside of the removable cover which stretches from the blacked out windscreen at the front to the black hook-like knob at the back.  The RC receiver, autopilot, GPS and telemetry radio were inserted through the hole and then attached using 3M double sided adhesive foam. The 3cm x 10cm hole was then closed using duct tape."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:25
#: 96fec52a40384503a80d6ad17fa9ad63
msgid "The battery power module was left in the main open area of the frame but partially protected from getting wet using a red balloon that came with the set (intended for use with the RC receiver)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:30
#: f5cab9a0b5c748c788efc1a046fcffb3
msgid "Firmware used: Rover-3.5.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:32
#: 6d4b5da921b54ddabc28c1a1a5edc16b
msgid "Parameter file: `HK-HydroProInception-Rover350.param <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/APMrover2-stable/Tools/Frame_params/HK-HydroProInception-Rover350.param>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:34
